* Canonical operation payloads or their verified hashes.
* Ordered event IDs.
* Ordered event hashes.
* Imported Vector Language module commitments.
* Relevant authorization commitments.
* Execution metadata that affects deterministic results.

Use the full cryptographic digest.

Do not use a shortened 64-bit value as the security identity of a proposal.

A compact display ID may exist for user interfaces, but all protocol verification must bind to the complete digest.

